  "categorias": "Deportes|Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p>(31 fotos) La sala La Cassola de la Casa de Cultura de Onda ha acogido este viernes la presentaci&oacute;n del XI Circuit Diputaci&oacute; de Curses de Muntanya. Ha intervenido una persona por cada uno de los seis municipios donde se organizan pruebas: la Vall d&#39;Uix&oacute;, Fondeguilla, la Vilavella, Onda, Nules y Sant Joan de Mor&oacute;.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/01/IMG_3531.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Han cerrado el acto el diputado provincial de Deportes, Luis Mart&iacute;nez Fuentes, y el alcalde de Onda, Ximo Huguet Lecha.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenondaxicircuitcursesmuntanyadiputacio/circuit-curses-muntanya-2017.jpg\" alt=\"circuit-curses-muntanya-2017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenondaxicircuitcursesmuntanyadiputacio/img_3500.jpg\" alt=\"img_3500\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenondaxicircuitcursesmuntanyadiputacio/img_3501.jpg\" alt=\"img_3501\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenondaxicircuitcursesmuntanyadiputacio/img_3503.jpg\" alt=\"img_3503\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenondaxicircuitcursesmuntanyadiputacio/img_3505.jpg\" alt=\"img_3505\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenondaxicircuitcursesmuntanyadiputacio/img_3506.jpg\" alt=\"img_3506\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenondaxicircuitcursesmuntanyadiputacio/img_3507.jpg\" alt=\"img_3507\" style=\"max-width